abstract: >-
  Author-developed analysis and reproducibility code supporting the CHE701P MSc
  dissertation Accelerating Molecular Simulations with MLFFs, including tacrine
  microhydration analysis, pretrained-MLFF inference, same-configuration
  B3LYP/6-31G(d) energetic-ordering analysis, Gaussian-path processing,
  path-local energy/force benchmarking and disagreement-based retrospective
  prioritisation.
keywords:
  - machine-learned force fields
  - molecular simulation
  - microhydration
  - tacrine
  - reproducibility
